1911:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Pms/Std/IfxPmsEvr.h ****         break;
1912:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Pms/Std/IfxPmsEvr.h ****     case IfxPmsEvr_DcdcSynchronization_output:
