 357:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h **** 
 358:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h **** /** \brief 3 millisecond wait time for Crystal Osc to stabilize
